HELDHEADER|step=13-rainbor-light-stones-matrix-2026-08-10|date=2026-10-19|rule=OWNER-RULES HOLD (files over 50 MB: pin by blob and sha256 and say where they live; vault CONTENTS) + OWNER-RULES 7.j|note=Blob ids recorded only; nothing in these rows is vendored. The HOLD decisions were re-checked against the bytes of all 771 vendored files (411 on 2026-10-19 at first writing, the 360 added from asolaria-stone-to-moss@97174e7 the same day): a scan for gh_/ghp_/gho_/github_pat_/sk-/AIza/hf_/xox/AKIA/Bearer/BEGIN .*PRIVATE KEY/ssh keys/password=/"token":/secret, api-key and access-token assignments, emails, phone numbers, whatsapp, tmp/docs, MASK_GLYPH, vote_quorum and reverse-gain found no credential, no email address, no phone number and no whatsapp string, and no rule-7.j component. Hits reviewed and kept: experiments/nested/ready_barrier.py builds 'Bearer ' + token from the GITHUB_TOKEN environment variable at run time (no value in the file); stage_huggingface.py, tools/publish_rainbow81_to_hf.py, PUBLICATION-INDEX.md and publication/2026-10-14/STATUS.json name the HF_TOKEN secret (a name, not a value); experiments/seat4/round5/sign_spectrum.js builds two Ed25519 keys from sha256('ASOLARIA-SEAT4-R5-<which>-TEST-ONLY-20261015'), test-only fixture keys that the file itself marks fixture_private_keys_publicly_derivable:true; seed_hex in experiments/seat4/B-CHALLENGE.json is the published challenge nonce; the IP-shaped 1.4.27.81 in RAINBOR THE-RAINBAR-OS-2026-08-08.hbp is its tick list; OMEGA-RAINBONTY-VERSE.html links a Hugging Face dataset labelled phone-archive-2026-08-04-private (a link with no content). Hits reviewed and kept in the 360 added files: tools/publish_four_seat_to_hf.py, publish_quantum_gravity_to_hf.py, publish_seat3_two_horizon_to_hf.py and publish_nnest_four_seat_to_hf.py read HF_TOKEN, GH_TOKEN or GITHUB_TOKEN from the environment and build 'Bearer ' + token at run time (names, no values); tracking/checkins/*, tracking/peer-audits/*, tracking/cross-seat-audits/* and the seat readiness stones carry Ed25519 public keys, signatures and sha256 commitments to salts and secrets that were never revealed (private_salt_revealed/secret_revealed false; no salt, secret or private key value); experiments/seat1/recurrence/PUBLIC-SIGNED-TEST-FIXTURE.json and experiments/seat2/recurrence/seat2_rim_signed_source_v1.json are public test-only Ed25519 vectors (public key and signature only, credential_class PUBLIC_TEST_VECTOR...); session_replay_gate.py draws its challenge from secrets.token_bytes at run time; experiments/seat3/pr111_custody/v2/pinned-github-api/*.json are public GitHub Actions run, job and merge metadata (ids, SHAs, times, no user data); the phone-shaped numbers 1751-1097 (a DOI) and 5878733220-4516776378 (an integer in an exact Fraction) are not phone numbers; the Hugging Face account Jessedbrown is the owner's public handle. The 360 added files hold no PNG, ZIP or other binary, no email address, no local user path and no rule-7.j component. The 12 PNGs carry no tEXt/iTXt/zTXt/eXIf chunk. Local paths (C:/Users/acer, D:/PID-Registration-Office, C:/asolaria-acer) in the hookwall rules and source are allowed, as in step 8. Kept and flagged in the README, not held: the owner's family named by first name in LIGHT and RAINBOR, with the family names Keators and Goodman; names only, no contact details, published by the owner.|json=0
